---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pageKey: gallery
pagination:
  data: languages
  size: 1
  alias: lang
  # Without this Eleventy puts only the FIRST paginated output into
  # collections, so the Spanish pages would be missing from the sitemap.
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
permalink: "{{ pageKey | localizedUrl(lang.code) }}"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ i18n[lang.code].gallery.title }}"
  description: "{{ i18n[lang.code].gallery.description }}"
---
{% set t = i18n[lang.code] %}
{% set g = t.gallery %}

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">{{ g.eyebrow }}</p>
    <h1 class="hero__title">{{ g.heroTitle }}</h1>
    <p class="hero__lead">{{ g.heroLead }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="todo">
      <strong>Awaiting photography</strong>
      New photographs are being taken for the center. Until they arrive this
      page stays unlinked from the main navigation or is left out of the
      launch entirely, whichever the client prefers.
      <br /><br />
      Before any photograph showing a child's face is published, a signed
      publicity release must be on file for that child, and the client must
      confirm in writing that every supplied image is cleared for public web
      use. Record each clearance in docs/photo-release-log.md.
      <br /><br />
      Drop final images in src/assets/img/gallery/ and add their alt text to
      BOTH i18n bundles, never inline in this template.
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/cta-band.njk" %}
